; The unmodified systemd-remount-fs unit invokes its exact normal ELF with no
; arguments. That ELF selects only /, /usr and API entries from the admitted
; fstab, and execs the normal mount ELF with path,-o,remount.
; The current native fstab remounts only the root labeledfs superblock.
